{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26118","headline":"荐冰 · 范传质","name":"荐冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘春方啓闭，羞献有常程。\n洁朗寒光彻，辉华素彩明。\n色凝霜雪净，影照冕旒清。\n肃肃将崇礼，兢兢示捧盈。\n方圆陈玉座，小大表精诚。\n朝觌当西陆，桃弧每共行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范传质","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}